ss=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Allendale County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids, October to November came in under 90% of normal in 41 of those years, more than any other pair, and it is also the driest pair at 5.32 inches. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 152% of normal in May to June but only 46% in November to December. So far in 2026, March to April came in at 18% of normal on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
